    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>The Shepherd Frère Marc Embraced wildlife expert Célèste Lamontagne for her near-religious appreciation of nature, but her instincts drew her to the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.e763657e5a404aff]{Path of Harmony} rather than his own Nocturnal Redemption, creating a lasting rift between sire and childe. She joined the nomadic Navigators in 1983, befriending pack priest Miguel Santo Domingo over their shared disdain for vampiric power games, and has become a fierce, loyal warrior for the pack, delighting especially in wrecking @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla} operations. She ranges the forests of Quebec, Ontario, and New York, has made uneasy allies among Country @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.zCWdD1NpOCn03CwE]{Gangrel} and even a few Garou, and leads the informal @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} band Wyldchylde.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Free and comfortable with your existence. Some think you weak; you delight in proving them wrong.</p><h2>Secrets</h2><p>Célèste's Lupine contacts have told her that they avoid Montreal because the ground is cursed.</p>",
    "notes": "Embraced 1979. Apparent age: mid-20s. Bears the marks of multiple frenzies, including pointed ears and light-reflecting eyes; has assumed a Lupine \"wolf-man\" form twice while lost to battle fury. @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.e763657e5a404aff]{Path of Harmony} 8. Disciplines (as printed): Animalism 4, Celerity 2, Fortitude 3, Potence 2, Protean 5.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
