      "name": "Protean — 3 Advanced — Flesh of Marble",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Spend two Blood Traits to instantly turn your skin into flexible living stone for the rest of the scene. All incoming physical damage (fists, claws, blades, firearms, explosions) is halved, round up, though fire, sunlight, and magic are unaffected. Bashing attacks also lose one health level of damage before halving, and melee weapons used against you risk shattering on a lost Simple Test unless exceptionally well-made.</p>",
        "source": "Camarilla Guide, Disciplines",
        "discipline": "Protean",
        "level": "advanced",
        "challengeType": "static",
        "bloodCost": "Two Blood Traits",
