      "name": "Protean — 3 Advanced — Animal Swarm",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The vampire disperses into one small creature per current Blood Trait spent (or fewer, larger creatures sharing Blood Traits evenly). Lasts until sunrise or voluntary reformation; any creatures not reabsorbed by dawn are destroyed. Difficult to represent at the table &mdash; Storytellers should plan in advance how a single player represents a swarm.</p>",
