      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>You may enter a controlled frenzy at will by winning or tying a Simple Test, choosing your own targets while the frenzy otherwise plays out normally; failure drops you into an uncontrolled frenzy instead. You may also regain composure during an uncontrolled frenzy with a Self-Control Challenge, spending a Willpower Trait each turn to hold onto that control until Willpower runs out or the frenzy is ended normally.</p>",
        "source": "Camarilla Guide, Disciplines",
